(7447001, 1178224, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna love hearing the back story on this space. I''m fond of the image, it has a matter-of-factedness to it that appeals, but it really doesn''t speak very much to the "effective use of grain" in my eyes Balancing those, it''s a 6.</td>', 'I''m gonna love hearing the back story on this space. I''m fond of the image, it has a matter-of-factedness to it that appeals, but it really doesn''t speak very much to the "effective use of grain" in my eyes Balancing those, it''s a 6.', '2016-04-01 01:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447002, 1178309, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah. There we go :-)</td>', 'Oh yeah. There we go :-)', '2016-04-01 01:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447078, 1178561, 20608, '<td valign="top">Well, I love portraiture, it''s what I like to do, this is done well, lit well and has the right amount of grain in it for me to dig out my old awards (not too many get handed out these days). 10<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1006779" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006779.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006779.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006779.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Well, I love portraiture, it''s what I like to do, this is done well, lit well and has the right amount of grain in it for me to dig out my old awards (not too many get handed out these days). 10 ', '2016-04-01 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447080, 1178595, 20608, '<td valign="top">The grain is adding to this image which is well lit &amp; the composition is rather pleasing to the eye as well. I like still life''s and I enjoy the simplicity this one offers, the stem from the Pear breaks the silence. Please accept this award. 9<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1006780" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006780.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006780.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006780.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The grain is adding to this image which is well lit & the composition is rather pleasing to the eye as well. I like still life''s and I enjoy the simplicity this one offers, the stem from the Pear breaks the silence. Please accept this award. 9 ', '2016-04-01 12:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447083, 1178599, 20608, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, love the depth to it and the way the light plays with the movement of the branches. I seldom give out these awards these days but feel free to accept or bin it ;)  8.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1006781" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006781.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006781.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/20000-24999/20608/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1006781.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is wonderful, love the depth to it and the way the light plays with the movement of the branches. I seldom give out these awards these days but feel free to accept or bin it ;)  8. ', '2016-04-01 12:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
